: "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175727.png", "id": "1630611974467428", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75411988_1630611977800761_7635821973011666471_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dTF6LoR_WwUQ7kNvwESfdkI&_nc_oc=Adly1-J1Mcby5w_OPWwp__7-JN6tC2wmcH8TN-XSJ7o6rlNpEP66cPo2Lx07JLm-K9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvwjiDqwP8SzNLldh7u6-p-HGMz31YntSrQDIv1AZRkfg&oe=69A41C2E"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175713.png", "id": "549067324527740", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210389_549067327861073_2529266429934636058_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MMI1ar542y4Q7kNvwGkC8B8&_nc_oc=Adnk3Tqh4APwpZN3t-4VGymWjRr5b5fd_xnDJRd9qtE7S9ZN1V3yOf8R5DNFXxIInUI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsd9iaf5O8qzD6PE_zTpe4pVOOwZrV6QrqNvzjl-AdhHQ&oe=69A437FB"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175750.png", "id": "1233285141120740", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974456_1233285144454073_4577451540501517425_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=B8a4AugM81MQ7kNvwEFWUca&_nc_oc=AdlrQ12Q4b8wYqhOmuD7tgUrjN7IGIAXpoVvyft8iGWNUf7pXqfNRxkVmF18jf5WYUM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfujcDhXg6EoG68IbecSWKR7NtQeW4E2N6Y6HU6OzDaGjg&oe=69A43D8F"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175810 (1).png", "id": "1549630812590254", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984460_1549630815923587_3757692530628789073_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C0IIxQ2r7ioQ7kNvwG6fzqI&_nc_oc=AdlUlNh2b9wt3CPagB8xflcg6_y2H7QotQh-DSrdEcY7O8SkKPDjj75nfFEOhKtZJDk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftsjamGHHHeuLvUQaRGrmRX9VgSkPHvuRnHAE43gkND-g&oe=69A435A3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wells Taggers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer runs out. Runners must avoid being tagged and use the environment and power-ups to outmaneuver the Taggers.\n\nGame Modes:\n\nClassic Tag: Traditional tag mode where Taggers must tag all Runners to win.\nInfected Tag: Tagged players become Taggers, spreading the infection until only one Runner remains.\nFreeze Tag: Tagged players are frozen in place until a teammate unfreezes them. Taggers win by freezing all players.\nMaps:\n\nUrban Playground: Navigate through a bustling cityscape with rooftops, alleys, and parks.\nEnchanted Forest: A magical forest filled with hiding spots and mystical creatures.\nSpace Station: A futuristic environment with zero-gravity zones and space-themed obstacles.\nPower-Ups:\n\n\n", "short_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer."}]}, "developer_name": "Wells_VR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/wellstaggersprivacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wells_VR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/wellstaggers